  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Disability Capacity Building Programme Funding - Sightsavers and International Disability Alliance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding to support the growth and development of the global disability movement. This provides advocacy training for organisations of persons with disabilities (ODA) delivered by the International Disability Alliance (IDA), the secretariats for the Global Disability Summit (GDS) and Global Action for Disability (GLAD) network, and for Sightsavers to provide IDA with organisational capacity-building support.</narrative>
  </description>
